  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Fira Sans', Ubuntu, Oxygen, 'Oxygen Sans', Cantarell, 'Droid Sans', 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Lucida Grande', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Moxie Media provides businesses with best-in-class online training, interactive media, and video production.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Fira Sans', Ubuntu, Oxygen, 'Oxygen Sans', Cantarell, 'Droid Sans', 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Lucida Grande', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Moxie Media helps companies build safer and more productive workplaces through safety, security, and health training programs. With hundreds of online courses and certifications, Moxie Media is a trusted resource for Maritime, Oil and Gas, and OSHA-required training.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Fira Sans', Ubuntu, Oxygen, 'Oxygen Sans', Cantarell, 'Droid Sans', 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Lucida Grande', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Our mission is to deliver the most effective media solutions for every client’s unique business needs.&nbsp;</span></p></div>",
